This repository contains project-authored mathematical exposition, reference algorithms, verification software, worked encodings, research-context documentation, and reproducibility infrastructure for Shunyaya Cyber Resilience Theory.

SCRT develops exact finite-interface semantics for operational and independently certified cyber resilience. The theorem chain includes contract-relative continuation classification, role-polarized silent-assurance obstruction, adversarial assurance campaigns, assurance-coherent hardening, target-bounded local interaction, the conflict-free versus exclusive-resource global audit boundary, and the corresponding fixed-target computational phase boundary.

